  "files": {},
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Reward models learn from pairwise preferences",
    "description": "A reward model scores a prompt-response pair with a scalar. Human or AI preference labels form (x,y+,y\u2212) pairs. Bradley\u2013Terry predicts preference with sigmoid(r+\u2212r\u2212), and training minimizes the negative log-sigmoid of the reward gap."
  }
}
